AIC8800 SDIO: Linux API compatibility and Wi-Fi-only bring-up

SDIO subset of the existing m28k mainline port; shared with A5E.
Do not patch USB/PCIe transports: they are not built here and have drifted
in the pinned Radxa source. Apply 0002 afterwards for Linux 6.18.

